    "source": "MarketWatch",
    "sourceUrl": "https://www.marketwatch.com/story/solaredges-stock-is-shedding-a-quarter-of-its-value-as-sales-woes-trump-ai-progress-8ce8159d?mod=mw_rss_topstories",
    "publishedAt": "2026-08-05T18:31:00+00:00",
